/T (Sivakumar Reddy M., Founder & CEO of Joindevops & Linuscode Technologies, is an expert in strategic leadership with extensive experience in DevOps, cloud computing, Java development, IoT, telecom, banking, media, and R&D. He specializes in modern cloud-native application development, guiding businesses through legacy-to-cloud migrations, and ensuring robust cloud security and cost optimization. Sivakumar is a leader in integrating DevSecOps practices across projects and excels at optimizing performance in modern architectures. With a passion for exploring advancements in cloud technologies and modern development practices, he is committed to driving innovation and delivering cutting-edge solutions for his clients.)
