/T (Why Choose DevSecOps? As organizations become more reliant on technology and data, the security of software has become increasingly important. DevSecOps makes security a collaborative, continuous, and automated part of the DevOps process, leading to better, safer software. In a world of increasing cybersecurity threats, DevSecOps represents the next step in the evolution of DevOps, helping teams not only deliver software fast but also deliver secure software without compromising on speed or quality.)
